{"id":"4ddc297472634c04","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-converse-wf-transitive.md","title":"Converse Well-Foundedness Does Not Imply Transitivity","display":"prop-converse-wf-transitive — Converse Well-Foundedness Does Not Imply Transitivity","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-converse-wf-transitive","aliases":["89-prop-converse-wf-transitive"],"display":"prop-converse-wf-transitive — Converse Well-Foundedness Does Not Imply Transitivity","depends_on":["[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]","[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-converse-wf-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-converse-wf-transitive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-converse-wf-transitive — Converse Well-Foundedness Does Not Imply Transitivity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae4d761acfb9353d\" href=\"?note=ae4d761acfb9353d\" title=\"89-df-converse-well-founded\">89-df-converse-well-founded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(W=\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{(0,1),(1,2)\\}\">\\(R=\\{(0,1),(1,2)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(p)=\\varnothing\">\\(V(p)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}_W(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}_W(R)\\)</span> 为逆良基性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}((W,R))\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}((W,R))\\)</span> 为框架传递性。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}converse\\text{-}wf\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{CWF}_W(R)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Trans}((W,R)),\\\\\n&amp;M,0\\models\\Box(\\Box p\\to p),\\qquad M,0\\not\\models\\Box p,\\\\\n&amp;M,0\\not\\models\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\\to\\Box p.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}converse\\text{-}wf\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{CWF}_W(R)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Trans}((W,R)),\\\\\n&amp;M,0\\models\\Box(\\Box p\\to p),\\qquad M,0\\not\\models\\Box p,\\\\\n&amp;M,0\\not\\models\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\\to\\Box p.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 4 章，印刷页 74–77；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n此有限无环关系逆良基，但缺少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,2)\">\\((0,2)\\)</span>。世界 1 的后继 2 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 假，所以世界 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span> 为假而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\\to p\">\\(\\Box p\\to p\\)</span> 为真；世界 0 因而满足前提而不满足结论。这个见证显示 Löb 框架条件必须同时要求传递性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-converse-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ae4d761acfb9353d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W=\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{(0,1),(1,2)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"V(p)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CWF}_W(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}((W,R))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}converse\\text{-}wf\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{CWF}_W(R)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Trans}((W,R)),\\\\\n&M,0\\models\\Box(\\Box p\\to p),\\qquad M,0\\not\\models\\Box p,\\\\\n&M,0\\not\\models\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\\to\\Box p.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(0,2)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\